      "content": "i get that it's a lot, but my friend told me that mega-dosing vitamins helps flush out toxins and that vitamin C is actually super good for the renal system. if i take it with a ton of water, won't that just help prevent the stones from forming by keeping everything moving? i'm just trying to be proactive.",
